      "body": "## Fix verification \u2014 `0118e4772`\n\nThe focused fix now passes the exact strict acceptance gate:\n\n- `AO_CHATUI_E2E_PORT=5201 npm run qa:chatui -- --grep MQA-01` \u2014 **PASS**\n- ChatUI typecheck \u2014 **PASS**\n- MQA-01 Playwright contract \u2014 **1/1 PASS**\n- `TurnSettingsBar.test.tsx` \u2014 **6/6 PASS**\n- ChatUI runner tests \u2014 **28/28 PASS**\n- Codex spec review \u2014 **no findings**\n- Codex standards review \u2014 **no findings**\n\nThe UI now scopes the warning to Claude Code, replaces provider-controlled false-boundary labels and descriptions, handles mode catalogs identified by `id`, and leaves other providers unchanged. A filtered MQA-06 guard run still executed its mapped tagged Go contract, so focused certification does not hide that known-red regression.\n\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Claude Code Plan mode disclosure passing in ChatUI\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/81e4d06f-1777-4c20-bae0-e6bd85305cca\" />\n\nFull screenshot/video/trace/report artifacts remain local in ignored `e2e-artifacts`; none are committed. Implementation: #4433.",
